  "question": {
    "text": "In the given circuit, initially switch <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is closed and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> are open. After charging of the capacitor, at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is open and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> are closed. If the relation between inductance, capacitance and resistance is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then find the time (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>) after which the current passing through the capacitor and inductor will be the same. [given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>mH</mi></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0121_46d27302db8a.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 175px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Charge on capacitor after complete charging<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi></math><br /><br />Now at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></math> two circuits are formed,<p>(A)&nbsp; Discharging of capacitor</p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>C&#949;e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>C&#949;e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>RC</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>RC</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />(B) Growth of current in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> circuit<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />now <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8195;</mo><mo>&#8195;</mo><mo>&#8195;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />given <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>"
